  "description": "One batch of dough, two 900 g boules, one oven, one Dutch oven, one refrigerator, one baker. Clock starts at 08:00 (t = 0); the loaves come out of the fridge the next day. The two bakes are ONE replicated chain (replicates: {count: 2} on 'Score & load', with 'instances: each' descendants) — never copied tracks. dutchOven maxConcurrent: 1 is what makes them bake one after the other, and maxInFlight: 1 holds the second boule in the fridge until the first is out of the oven, so it is scored exactly when the pot has re-heated.",
